libwefts
------------------------------------------
Wefts++ is an high-level abstraction C++ threading library, which has also
seamless integration with low level constructs when raw speed is needed.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libwefts-devel-0.99c-1bl5
  libwefts2-0.99c-1bl5
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://wefts.sourceforge.net/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/wefts/libwefts-0.99c.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libwefts-0.99c-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libwefts-0.99c-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libwefts-0.99c-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwefts-0.99c-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwefts2-0.99c-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwefts-devel-0.99c-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

